                        ],
                        "form": "дровяника́х"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57c8a318-1973-312e-a63d-a9d1332de86e",
                        "entry_id": "752c9f30-b54c-3872-808e-08da1ce556a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "сарай для дров при жилом доме"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad9e1757-45cf-4fdd-8102-336252b0008b",
                                "sense_id": "57c8a318-1973-312e-a63d-a9d1332de86e",
                                "text": "Дровяник стоял без крыши, но его дальнейшая разборка застопорилась ― тетка с тихим упорством настаивала, что сперва надо построить новые дровяник и угольник: «А дожди пойдут, и где топливо брать сухое?»"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db9cc588-a28c-44b4-a5c0-75c5a1ee2e97",
                                "sense_id": "57c8a318-1973-312e-a63d-a9d1332de86e",
                                "text": "Перерыл весь свой дровяник, березовое полешко отыскивал ― напрасно время потратил."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f91341d5-8466-3b0c-8b62-f64ffa82bdb7",
                        "entry_id": "752c9f30-b54c-3872-808e-08da1ce556a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "торговец дровами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27700f79-c695-4e1a-a828-80c2e11ce1af",
                                "sense_id": "f91341d5-8466-3b0c-8b62-f64ffa82bdb7",
                                "text": "Её лучшая приятельница ― девица Женя, квартирующая в номере двенадцатом, тихая, аккуратная в плате за квартиру, полная блондинка, которую содержит какой-то купец-дровяник, но которая в свободные дни водит к себе кавалеров с улицы."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "034a24d5-61ed-3b95-a37d-e785a69e7e6c",
                        "entry_id": "752c9f30-b54c-3872-808e-08da1ce556a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "собир. срубленные деревья низкого качества, годные только на дрова"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "da2881af-bfc2-461a-bf35-54a89e2a340a",
                        "source_entry_id": "752c9f30-b54c-3872-808e-08da1ce556a5",
                        "source_sense_description": "дровяной сарай",
                        "target_lang_word": "woodshed",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "woodshed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdd96b01-15e3-3937-a1e6-3c21e3afe435",
                                        "entry_id": "c8002d9b-c58a-328f-92d2-1b22b19a86fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An enclosed, roofed structure, often an outbuilding, used primarily to store firewood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9443ef01-d919-370c-b841-22c672df90f6",
                                        "entry_id": "c8002d9b-c58a-328f-92d2-1b22b19a86fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where punishments or reprimands are administered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f7ec218-2b26-4d59-bfd8-4931339e9abb",
                                                "sense_id": "9443ef01-d919-370c-b841-22c672df90f6",
                                                "text": "The State Department is incensed, and if this conference fails it will be the woodshed for three Central American presidents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29a5aa43-e08f-4cf3-bc7c-85d8667abcc4",
                                                "sense_id": "9443ef01-d919-370c-b841-22c672df90f6",
                                                "text": "Were you ever taken to the woodshed? Did anyone say, “Stop disagreeing with the president”?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "woodshed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3853b45c-1a5e-3c0a-a8eb-f6cf7aaf148c",
                                        "entry_id": "d6984bb2-6285-3a9e-a5d6-41c7594911b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To practice or rehearse using a musical instrument."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a21fc6d-23be-4a78-807d-cca39754cf83",
                                                "sense_id": "3853b45c-1a5e-3c0a-a8eb-f6cf7aaf148c",
                                                "text": "Recently, I have taken up the double bass again, but because time and neglect erode ability, calluses turn soft, and muscle memory fades, I need to woodshed (practice) to get back into shape and build up my chops."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee128796-a6e2-33ca-9ea9-aea1c1271b25",
                                        "entry_id": "d6984bb2-6285-3a9e-a5d6-41c7594911b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To practice or rehearse a script."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47291029-b5b8-4cfd-8f9c-99f3d71cde2c",
                                                "sense_id": "ee128796-a6e2-33ca-9ea9-aea1c1271b25",
                                                "text": "In previous chapters, I've covered many ways to woodshed a script and dozens of techniques for bringing the words to life. Now, I'm going to suggest something completely different: Try performing your script completely cold the first time through."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f6a6403-c248-306d-9835-b9dd14103dba",
                                        "entry_id": "d6984bb2-6285-3a9e-a5d6-41c7594911b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To self-isolate in order to work on one's artistic development or to produce work without interruptions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4225c646-4432-400b-8997-469b2b6a3bda",
                                                "sense_id": "9f6a6403-c248-306d-9835-b9dd14103dba",
                                                "text": "His latest novel sheds light on an émigré writer’s woodshedding period."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1f139935-bbc0-49fb-826b-d1e4d9f6c218",
